{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00310","headline":"奉和御制麟德殿宴百官 · 尚宫宋氏若宪","name":"奉和御制麟德殿宴百官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"端拱承休命，时清荷圣皇。\n四聪闻受谏，五服远朝王。\n景媚莺初啭，春残日更长。\n命筵多济济，盛乐复锵锵。\n酆镐谁将敌，横汾未可方。\n愿齐山岳寿，祉福永无疆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"尚宫宋氏若宪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00310.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00310","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}